ciation":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2862514591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2862661598","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106167#issuecomment-2862661598","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106167","id":2862661598,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qoL_e","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-08T11:10:43Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T11:10:43Z","body":"This is super weird, I never managed to reproduce the error in the project manager update (it's also a single call, so there really shouldn't be any concurrency issue).\r\n\r\nSimilarly, I've tried multiple times to get an error in the asset lib, and I can't reproduce the issue with the PR.\r\nI can only reproduce the original issue without the patch.\r\n\r\nIs it possible that for some reason you are building with mismatching headers (e.g. 