 seems to happen with `scons dev_build=yes` but not `scons`, so it's something to do with `DEV_ENABLED`, no optimization, or debug symbols.\r\n\r\nI believe it's orthogonal to this issue/PR, it appeared yesterday in my local builds while what this fixes dates back to 4.4-dev.\r\n\r\nI'll test this PR with an optimized build (`scons`) to validate the fix, and debug my local issue further independently.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2862787764/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2867182561","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106167#issuecomment-2867182561","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106167","id":2867182561,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6q5bvh","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-09T16:35:14Z","updated_at":"2025-05-09T16:35:14Z","body":"Thanks!","aut